    <briefdescription>
<para>A wrapper around a string literal that serves as a proxy for constructing global tables of StringRefs with the length computed at compile time. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>In order to avoid the invocation of a global constructor, <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_string_literal" kindref="compound">StringLiteral</ref> should <emphasis>only</emphasis> be used in a constexpr context, as such:</para>
<para>constexpr <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_string_literal" kindref="compound">StringLiteral</ref> S(&quot;test&quot;); </para>
    </detaileddescription>
